 const titles={STR:'Strength · lineage attack scaling',DEX:'Dexterity · lineage scaling and reveal order',CON:'Constitution · health and shields',INT:'Intelligence · lineage attack scaling',WIS:'Wisdom · healing and resistance',CHA:'Charisma · lineage attack scaling and weaken'};
 setContent(`<section class="workshop" id="pet-workshop" data-panel="${workshopPanel}" style="--lineage:${l.color}"><div class="workshop-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">PET WORKSHOP</span><h1>${esc(me.pet.name)}</h1></div><span class="save-state" role="status">${me.busy?'ENTRY LOCKED':dirty?'UNSAVED BUILD':'SAVED BUILD'}</span><div class="actions">${button('Reset draft','reset-build','quiet',me.busy?'disabled':'')}${button('Save build','save-build','primary',me.busy?'disabled':'')}</div></div><div class="workshop-mobile-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Workshop panels">${button('Loadout & epic','workshop-panel',workshopPanel==='moves'?'active':'',`data-panel="moves" aria-pressed="${workshopPanel==='moves'}"`)}${button('Stats','workshop-panel',workshopPanel==='stats'?'active':'',`data-panel="stats" aria-pressed="${workshopPanel==='stats'}"`)}</div><div class="workshop-body"><aside class="workshop-fighter"><div class="workshop-rig"><canvas id="workshop-pet" aria-label="${esc(l.name)} existing battle rig"></canvas></div><div class="workshop-identity">${portrait(me.pet)}<div><strong>${esc(l.short)}</strong><small>LV ${b.level} · ${b.maxHp} HP</small><small>Canonical Pet appearance</small></div></div><div class="passive-note"><span class="eyebrow">LINEAGE PASSIVE</span><p>${esc(l.passive)}</p><small>${esc(l.tool)} · verified gear stats apply separately</small></div></aside><section class="workshop-stats"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Attributes</h2><span class="points-badge">${b.statPoints.available} available</span></div><div class="stats">${STATS.map(k=>`<div class="stat" title="${titles[k]}"><small>${k}</small><strong>${b.stats[k]}</strong>${button('−','stat','',`data-key="${k}" data-delta="-1" aria-label="Decrease ${k}" ${me.busy||!(draft.allocation[k]>0)?'disabled':''}`)}${button('+','stat','',`data-key="${k}" data-delta="1" aria-label="Increase ${k}" ${me.busy?'disabled':''}`)}</div>`).join('')}</div><p class="stat-guide">CON: health & shields<br>WIS: healing & resistance<br>Attack scaling: ${l.scale.join(' / ')}<br>Above 16 costs two points.</p><small>${b.statPoints.spent} / ${b.statPoints.earned} points allocated.<br>These are Arena build stats, not Hatchery XP.</small></section><section class="workshop-loadout"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Four move slots</h2><span class="points-badge">${b.skillPoints.available} skill points</span></div><div class="loadout-strip">${b.loadout.map((k,i)=>`<div class="loadout-tile"><kbd>${i+1}</kbd><span class="ability-symbol" aria-hidden="true">${moveSymbol(k,b.skills[k])}</span><strong>${esc(b.skills[k].name)}</strong><small>Rank ${b.ranks[k]||0} · ${b.skills[k].cost?b.skills[k].cost+' EN':'FREE'}</small></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="skill-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Move collection">${[['attack','Offense'],['defense','Defense'],['epic','Epic']].map(([branch,label])=>button(label,'workshop-branch',workshopBranch===branch?'active':'',`data-branch="${branch}" aria-pressed="${workshopBranch===branch}"`)).join('')}</div>${workshopBranch==='epic'?`<div class="workshop-epic"><span class="epic-emblem" aria-hidden="true">${uiIcon('epic')}</span><h2>${esc(l.epic)}</h2><p>${moveText(values({build:b},'epic'))}</p><p>Learn at Lv. 6 · master at Lv. 10<br>100 charge · ${esc(l.condition)}<br>Once per battle; separate from four slots.</p><div class="actions">${button(draft.ranks.epic?'Upgrade epic':'Learn epic · 1 point','rank','epic-button',`data-key="epic" data-delta="1" ${b.level<6||(draft.ranks.epic||0)>=2||me.busy?'disabled':''}`)}${button('Refund','rank','quiet',`data-key="epic" data-delta="-1" ${!draft.ranks.epic||me.busy?'disabled':''}`)}</div><small>Rank I costs 1 · Rank II costs another 2</small></div>`:`<div class="skill-list">${Object.values(skills).filter(m=>m.branch===workshopBranch).map(m=>{const locked=m.level>b.level,chosen=draft.loadout.includes(m.key),rank=draft.ranks[m.key]||0,v=values({build:b},m.key);return `<article class="skill-row ${chosen?'selected':''} ${locked?'locked':''}"><button class="skill-equip" data-action="equip" data-key="${m.key}" aria-label="${chosen?'Equipped: ':'Equip '}${esc(m.name)}" ${locked||me.busy?'disabled':''}><span class="ability-symbol" aria-hidden="true">${moveSymbol(m.key,m)}</span><span><strong>${esc(m.name)}</strong><small>${moveText(v)}</small><small>${locked?'UNLOCK LV. '+m.level:chosen?'SLOT '+(draft.loadout.indexOf(m.key)+1):'SELECT SLOT'} · ${m.cost} energy · CD ${m.cooldown}</small></span></button><div class="skill-rank"><small>Rank ${rank}</small>${button('+','rank','',`data-key="${m.key}" data-delta="1" aria-label="Upgrade ${esc(m.name)}" ${locked||rank>=2||me.busy?'disabled':''}`)}${button('−','rank','quiet',`data-key="${m.key}" data-delta="-1" aria-label="Refund ${esc(m.name)} upgrade" ${!rank||me.busy?'disabled':''}`)}</div></article>`;}).join('')}</div>`}</section></div><p class="workshop-footnote">${me.busy?'Build frozen for your active entry. Finish or cancel before editing.':'Choose a move to replace one slot. Free respec between entries. Rank I: 1 point; Rank II: +2 points.'} · No battle XP or Hatchery changes.</p></section>`);
 if(me.pet.identitySource==='AUTHENTICATED_PET_READ_V1'){const source=document.createElement('aside');source.className='verified-pet-launch';source.innerHTML=button('✓ Pet & equipped gear','verified-pet','quiet')+'<span>V1 combat bonuses · Preview styles stay cosmetic</span>';main.append(source);}renderer=new ArenaRenderer($('#workshop-pet'));renderer.hero=me.pet;
